---
Print a completion script for your shell.

Usage: ink completions <SHELL>

Arguments
  <SHELL>  The shell to print the script for

Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
More    ink completions --help adds examples, notes and exit codes
